<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your Email</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; 
            background-color: #f4f7f6; 
            padding: 40px 20px; 
            margin: 0;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .card { 
            background: #ffffff; 
            padding: 40px; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            max-width: 480px; 
            margin: 0 auto; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 128, 128, 0.08); 
            border-top: 5px solid #008080;
        }
        .logo-placeholder {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #008080;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #004d4d;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555555;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .btn-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .btn { 
            display: inline-block; 
            padding: 14px 32px; 
            background-color: #008080; 
            color: #ffffff !important; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            border-radius: 6px; 
            font-weight: 600; 
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 128, 128, 0.2);
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #006666;
        }
        .footer { 
            margin-top: 35px; 
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eef2f1;
            font-size: 12px; 
            color: #888888; 
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="logo-placeholder">EchoStream</div>
        
        <h2>Welcome, <%= fullName %>!</h2>
        <p>Thank you for signing up for EchoStream. To secure your account and unlock full access to our platform, please verify your email address by clicking the button below.</p>
        
        <div class="btn-container">
            <a href="<%= verificationLink %>" class="btn">Verify Email Address</a>
        </div>
        
        <p>Please note that this verification link will expire in 15 mins for security reasons.</p>
        
        <div class="footer">
            If you did not sign up for an EchoStream account, you can safely ignore or delete this email.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
